{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c042c4f2-688b-847a-9e86-cb7b94b8bf65",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:58:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luz Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Monday, sort of. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I paid a parking ticket online two weeks ago and I got a late notice in the mail on Saturday. So that's a problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll make your weekend. Let me look it up. Do you have the ticket number or your plate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the plate. It's a Rhode Island plate, two-one-seven-four-four-zero. Hang on, I'm on speakerphone, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little echo, but I've got you. Two-one-seven-four-four-zero. Give me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'm in the kitchen. The heat's low, so I'm wearing two sweaters and fuzzy socks. That's why I'm not moving much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a solid strategy. Okay, I see the ticket. Overnight parking, issued on Eustis Avenue. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In front of my house. Three eighty-five Eustis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And I do see a payment posted, but it looks like it came in a day after the late notice date was generated. So the notice and your payment crossed paths."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I paid it before the due date. I have the confirmation email. The date is on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then the confirmation date is what matters. I'm going to note the account so the late fee gets reviewed and taken off. You can ignore that notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Will I get something saying that it's cleared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The account will show a zero balance. If you want something in writing I can send a note, but check the balance in a few days too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Also, I want the photo of the violation. The officer's photo. I think the car was legal and I want to see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can email that. Photos are attached to the ticket record. What email address should I use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's luz dot pagan at the same address I used on the payment. Can you use the one on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. I'll send it to the one on file. It may take a day or so, but it'll come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if it doesn't, I'll call back at four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have that number on the note. If you don't see it by Wednesday, call me and ask for Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thanks. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Stay warm, Luz. Put a third sweater on if you have to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll consider it. Bye."
    }
  ],
